       "title": "Water Walking",
       "dose": "20–30 min · moderate (talk test)",
       "cues": [
        "Chest-deep water: walk forward, backward and sideways.",
        "Long, deliberate strides.",
        "Moderate pace: you can still hold a conversation."
       ]
      }
      ]
    },
